{"status":"ok","message-type":"work","message-version":"1.0.0","message":{"indexed":{"date-parts":[[2024,6,27]],"date-time":"2024-06-27T07:49:10Z","timestamp":1719474550920},"reference-count":23,"publisher":"Cambridge University Press (CUP)","license":[{"start":{"date-parts":[[2022,5,26]],"date-time":"2022-05-26T00:00:00Z","timestamp":1653523200000},"content-version":"unspecified","delay-in-days":25,"URL":"http:\/\/creativecommons.org\/licenses\/by-nc-nd\/4.0\/"}],"content-domain":{"domain":[],"crossmark-restriction":false},"short-container-title":["Proc. Des. Soc."],"published-print":{"date-parts":[[2022,5]]},"abstract":"<jats:title>Abstract<\/jats:title><jats:p>The comprehensive implementation of digital technologies in product manufacturing leads to changes in engineering processes and requires new approaches to data management. An important role belongs to the processes of organizing the collection, storage and reuse of research data obtained and used in the process of product, system or technology development, taking into account the FAIR data principles. This article describes a Research Data Management System for the organization of documentation and measurement requests in the research and development of new oxygen-free production technologies.<\/jats:p>","DOI":"10.1017\/pds.2022.54","type":"journal-article","created":{"date-parts":[[2022,5,26]],"date-time":"2022-05-26T04:41:15Z","timestamp":1653540075000},"page":"525-532","source":"Crossref","is-referenced-by-count":3,"title":["Knowledge Annotation within Research Data Management System for Oxygen-Free Production Technologies"],"prefix":"10.1017","volume":"2","author":[{"given":"I.","family":"Mozgova","sequence":"first","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"O.","family":"Altun","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author","vocabulary":"crossref"}]},{"given":"T.","family":"Sheveleva","sequence":"additional","affiliation":[],"role":[{"role":"author